{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24719","headline":"窗中列远岫 · 白居易","name":"窗中列远岫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天静秋山好，窗开晓翠通。\n遥怜峰窈窕，不隔竹朦胧。\n万点当虚室，千重叠远空。\n列檐攒秀气，缘隙助清风。\n碧爱新晴後，明宜反照中。\n宣城郡斋在，望与古时同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}